Title: West Belfast: Fire at GAA club started deliberately, police say
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Police Service of Northern Ireland (PSNI) Insp Dalton', 'Text': 'the fire is believed to have been started at around 18:20 BST on Saturday.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 52, 'EndChar': 111}}, {'Speaker': 'Insp Dalton', 'Text': 'the fire caused "extensive damage".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 34}}, {'Speaker': 'Insp Dalton', 'Text': '"It\'s absolutely unacceptable that a community organisation should be targeted in this way," he added.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 93}}, {'Speaker': 'Belfast city councillor Arder Carson', 'Text': 'the fire was a "blatant act of vandalism".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 37, 'EndChar': 78}}, {'Speaker': 'Arder Carson', 'Text': '"It definitely fills you with despair and some anger that a club that does so much for the local community in terms of working diligently to provide facilities and services that give young people hope and opportunity has been subject to such an attack."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 68, 'EndChar': 309}}, {'Speaker': 'Arder Carson', 'Text': 'the club was "in the heart" of preparing for its children\'s summer camps and the start of a new championship season.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 9, 'EndChar': 107}}, {'Speaker': 'Arder Carson', 'Text': '"Setting fire outdoors at any time is reckless but this level is just beyond reckless," Carson said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 91}}, {'Speaker': 'Arder Carson', 'Text': '"On the period of dry weather we have had, to set fires in an area like that which is rural and totally green is just beyond reckless."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 122}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Police say a fire which destroyed facilities at a west Belfast GAA club was started deliberately.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 83}}, {'Description': 'Police are appealing for anyone with information to contact them.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 62}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Burnt debris on a patch of grass following a fire. is a GAA pitch in the background, with a row of trees in front of it.'}]}
